{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1744","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E2. Divisible Numbers (hard version)"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"4 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This is an hard version of the problem. The only difference between an easy and a hard version is the constraints on $$$a$$$, $$$b$$$, $$$c$$$ and $$$d$$$."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given $$$4$$$ positive integers $$$a$$$, $$$b$$$, $$$c$$$, $$$d$$$ with $$$a \\lt c$$$ and $$$b \\lt d$$$. Find any pair of numbers $$$x$$$ and $$$y$$$ that satisfies the following conditions:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a \\lt x \\leq c$$$, $$$b \\lt y \\leq d$$$,"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$x \\cdot y$$$ is divisible by $$$a \\cdot b$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that required $$$x$$$ and $$$y$$$ may not exist."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains a single integer $$$t$$$ $$$(1 \\leq t \\leq 10$$$), the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The descriptions of the test cases follow."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The only line of each test case contains four integers $$$a$$$, $$$b$$$, $$$c$$$ and $$$d$$$ ($$$1 \\leq a \\lt c \\leq 10^9$$$, $$$1 \\leq b \\lt d \\leq 10^9$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case print a pair of numbers $$$a \\lt x \\leq c$$$ and $$$b \\lt y \\leq d$$$ such that $$$x \\cdot y$$$ is divisible by $$$a \\cdot b$$$. If there are multiple answers, print any of them. If there is no such pair of numbers, then print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"-1 -1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n10\n1 1 2 2\n3 4 5 7\n8 9 15 18\n12 21 14 24\n36 60 48 66\n1024 729 373248 730\n1024 729 373247 730\n5040 40320 40319 1000000000\n999999999 999999999 1000000000 1000000000\n268435456 268435456 1000000000 1000000000\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2 2\n4 6\n12 12\n-1 -1\n-1 -1\n373248 730\n-1 -1\n15120 53760\n-1 -1\n536870912 536870912\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E2","problemCode":"1744E2","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1744/problem/E2"}